WEBVTT

01:06.566 --> 01:08.193
You crazy bitch!

01:08.693 --> 01:10.695
If you want to drop out,
do it without a fuss.

01:10.779 --> 01:13.698
Did you do nothing wrong?
Not a single thing?

01:14.199 --> 01:16.534
If it's come to this,
there's something wrong with you too!

01:16.618 --> 01:18.620
Come redo your withdrawal form now!

01:56.116 --> 01:57.283
PARK YEON-JIN

01:57.367 --> 01:58.535
Yeon-jin!

01:59.702 --> 02:03.039
The rooftop of that abandoned building.

02:04.374 --> 02:05.792
You remember, don't you?

02:06.835 --> 02:10.213
That's when you lost
your name tag, you know.

02:10.296 --> 02:11.297
You remember, right?

02:11.381 --> 02:12.465
What the fuck is this?

02:13.508 --> 02:15.802
Go away. I said, go away!

02:42.579 --> 02:45.415
But… what are you doing here?

02:48.293 --> 02:50.003
You're dead. Why are you here?

02:52.297 --> 02:53.840
I thought I could smell burning flesh.

02:55.216 --> 02:58.887
You've got burns all over your body,
and your head is caved in.

03:00.597 --> 03:02.182
Why are you here? You're dead.

03:02.265 --> 03:04.934
What do you want
in the world of the living?

03:16.237 --> 03:18.448
Mother!

03:19.073 --> 03:20.408
Mother!

03:24.287 --> 03:25.455
Here…

03:26.664 --> 03:27.832
She…

03:28.583 --> 03:30.084
She's here!

03:31.628 --> 03:33.129
You…

03:36.758 --> 03:38.509
Mother!

03:43.223 --> 03:45.058
Beoljeon! It's beoljeon!

03:45.141 --> 03:47.393
BEOLJEON: GOD'S DEADLIEST PUNISHMENT
IN KOREAN SHAMANISM

05:00.300 --> 05:01.718
So your husband died.

05:03.928 --> 05:06.931
Is this what you and Dong-eun had planned?

05:08.099 --> 05:10.768
Getting my mom involved
in killing your husband?

05:11.352 --> 05:13.771
You're a murderer now, you fucking bitch!

05:15.273 --> 05:18.693
So this is why you didn't bat an eye
when I offered to kill him for you.

05:19.193 --> 05:20.862
Settle with my mom right now.

05:22.363 --> 05:24.365
You think I won't find your daughter?

05:26.576 --> 05:27.577
First,

05:28.661 --> 05:30.830
I have something to return to you, ma'am.

05:41.049 --> 05:42.216
You fucking bitch!

05:42.300 --> 05:44.635
How can you threaten
someone's child so easily?

05:45.136 --> 05:46.512
Aren't you a mother too?

05:47.013 --> 05:50.641
I have a lot of pictures of you.

05:51.517 --> 05:54.020
So don't mess with me.

05:56.022 --> 05:57.190
If you find me again,

05:57.940 --> 06:00.193
I'll give back twice as much as I get.

06:01.152 --> 06:02.320
Just like today.

06:05.031 --> 06:06.449
That fucking bitch!

06:17.043 --> 06:17.877
Do-yeong.

06:25.551 --> 06:26.636
Thank you, sir.

06:27.345 --> 06:30.014
If you need anything else,
call me anytime.

06:30.598 --> 06:32.016
You work for Shin, don't you?

06:32.517 --> 06:34.435
I heard he's leaving the country soon.

06:34.519 --> 06:37.605
He put his motel up for sale too.
The one in his sister's name.

06:39.399 --> 06:41.567
Well, then. Follow me.

06:42.902 --> 06:44.320
What are you doing here?

06:49.784 --> 06:51.411
Who were those people?

06:53.913 --> 06:55.498
You have two choices.

06:58.126 --> 06:59.710
The victim's family lives here.

07:01.003 --> 07:04.674
You may have forgotten,
but these people haven't.

07:06.092 --> 07:08.761
Either go there, apologize,
and accept your punishment…

07:11.556 --> 07:13.224
or our relationship ends here.

07:15.726 --> 07:16.811
Choose carefully.

07:19.313 --> 07:20.314
And so will I.

07:23.401 --> 07:25.194
Why would I go there?

07:26.571 --> 07:28.281
I didn't kill her.

07:29.198 --> 07:31.534
That bitch was freaking out.
Then she slipped--

07:31.617 --> 07:32.577
So you were there…

07:35.997 --> 07:37.165
when it happened.

07:41.544 --> 07:43.546
2941 SUNGHAN-RO, JONGNO-GU

07:48.468 --> 07:49.427
"Our relationship"?

07:50.887 --> 07:53.473
Our relationship was over
the moment you met up…

07:56.100 --> 07:57.185
with Dong-eun.

08:01.147 --> 08:03.232
Ah, I see.

08:08.404 --> 08:09.405
Take care, then.

08:11.365 --> 08:12.575
This is my choice.

08:17.914 --> 08:19.081
Mr. Choi, it's me.

08:28.508 --> 08:30.760
WAS PARK CUT OFF OVER BULLYING SCANDAL?

08:30.843 --> 08:32.386
PARK'S TEN-YEAR MARRIAGE ENDS

08:32.470 --> 08:33.804
WEATHERCASTER DIVORCED BY CEO

08:33.888 --> 08:35.014
HA FILES FOR DIVORCE

08:35.097 --> 08:36.390
Isn't he the CEO of Jaepyeong?

08:36.891 --> 08:42.271
SEARCH
PARK YEON-JIN

08:55.326 --> 08:58.246
"Jaepyeong Construction stated
that it cannot confirm

08:58.329 --> 09:01.290
whether recent rumors
about Park Yeon-jin's school violence

09:01.374 --> 09:05.086
were the driving force
behind the divorce."

09:05.169 --> 09:09.006
"They do not intend
to elaborate on this in the future."

09:10.800 --> 09:12.635
I guess Ha Do-yeong is single now.

09:13.553 --> 09:15.471
Heck, I really don't like that.

09:16.055 --> 09:18.140
Why don't you like it, Dr. Joo?

09:18.808 --> 09:21.686
Fuck, you said parental rights
would be stripped!

09:23.479 --> 09:25.481
You're friends with his lawyer, right?

09:26.232 --> 09:28.985
Meet him now.
Find out the conditions of the divorce.

09:32.572 --> 09:35.157
Fuck, why the hell
did they have to get a divorce?

09:36.826 --> 09:38.327
Think Jae-jun still loves her?

09:38.911 --> 09:40.538
They won't get together, right?

09:41.038 --> 09:44.458
Jae-jun said that he cums super quickly
when he sleeps with me.

09:45.209 --> 09:46.877
So, I must drive him wild, huh?

09:46.961 --> 09:49.630
That's premature ejaculation, you idiot!
I said, go away!

09:52.341 --> 09:54.427
I came to pay for the dress from before.

09:56.637 --> 10:01.434
Are you going to Myeong-o's funeral?
How much condolence money should I give?

10:01.517 --> 10:03.185
Fuck, seriously!

10:03.269 --> 10:05.646
Hey! Do I look like the FSS to you?

10:06.147 --> 10:08.482
Stop asking me
about the damn condolence money.

10:08.566 --> 10:12.486
Yeah, I can see it
now that Son Myeong-o's gone.

10:13.029 --> 10:14.530
It wasn't that prick.

10:15.072 --> 10:17.116
You're the biggest idiot around here.

10:18.200 --> 10:19.035
Hey, Sa-ra!

10:19.118 --> 10:23.581
You think saying "fuck" and "shit"
is the only form of insult. You're wrong!

10:23.664 --> 10:25.583
Humiliation is an insult too!

10:26.500 --> 10:29.420
Again, if it hadn't been Dong-eun
back then, it would've been you!

10:29.503 --> 10:32.673
You're our cheapest plaything, okay?

10:36.135 --> 10:38.554
I really was going to pay you
for the dress.

10:40.973 --> 10:42.224
So don't regret this.

10:42.933 --> 10:43.934
Actually,

10:44.852 --> 10:46.937
I hope you regret it, you junkie bitch.

10:47.021 --> 10:48.856
Get lost, you stupid bitch.

11:25.017 --> 11:27.770
We didn't get to go to the Philippines
and eat mangoes…

11:30.272 --> 11:31.357
but we've ended up

11:32.483 --> 11:33.651
at the ocean anyway.

11:36.904 --> 11:39.573
I'm wearing the last outfit
you picked out for me.

11:40.616 --> 11:43.619
What do you think? Does it look good?

11:48.124 --> 11:49.625
Don't worry about Sun-a.

11:51.877 --> 11:53.546
Don't forgive me either.

11:55.881 --> 11:57.675
I hope you rot in the cold ocean

11:59.385 --> 12:00.803
for a long, long time,

12:01.971 --> 12:02.805
honey.

12:20.656 --> 12:21.824
Ms. Kang Hyeon-nam?

12:23.701 --> 12:26.078
Are you Mr. Lee Seok-jae's
remaining family?

12:26.162 --> 12:28.581
I'm the driver's lawyer.

12:29.081 --> 12:32.752
She came here herself
in order to reach a settlement with you.

12:35.171 --> 12:37.965
I'm not planning on any settlement.
I won't do it.

12:38.048 --> 12:39.300
Please reconsider.

12:39.800 --> 12:42.470
The road was wet,
and it was very sudden for her too.

12:42.553 --> 12:43.387
Ma'am!

12:45.306 --> 12:47.475
My goodness, you must be so heartbroken.

12:47.975 --> 12:50.311
I know that I have no right to be here.

12:51.437 --> 12:52.605
But, you see,

12:52.688 --> 12:55.775
I have a daughter and a granddaughter.

12:56.275 --> 12:58.694
So please think about it.

12:59.195 --> 13:03.282
Maybe we can both calm down
and talk about money…

13:06.452 --> 13:09.121
I'm not going to settle,
so don't contact me.

13:09.914 --> 13:11.749
As you know, I'm in mourning right now.

13:12.333 --> 13:14.043
Ma'am?

13:18.714 --> 13:20.633
What do we do? She seems stubborn.

13:20.716 --> 13:22.134
Why are you asking me?

13:22.802 --> 13:25.846
You want me to go to prison? Huh?

13:27.389 --> 13:30.226
That bitch is something else.

13:31.310 --> 13:33.395
Laughing when she's in mourning?

13:33.938 --> 13:35.231
And wearing a floral dress?

13:37.316 --> 13:38.400
The settlement money.

13:39.944 --> 13:40.945
Double it.

13:51.789 --> 13:53.791
Move! You're blocking my way!

13:54.667 --> 13:58.337
Hello, I'm Moon Dong-eun.
You've probably forgotten about me.

13:58.420 --> 13:59.463
Who?

13:59.547 --> 14:01.549
Let me introduce myself again.

14:02.383 --> 14:05.302
I know you planned and carried out
the murder of Lee Seok-jae.

14:17.481 --> 14:18.732
Did Yeong-jun send you?

14:18.816 --> 14:21.318
No, I came here on my own.

14:22.319 --> 14:25.823
I walked here from the year 2004,
step by step.

14:29.201 --> 14:30.452
"Moon Dong-eun"?

14:32.413 --> 14:35.082
You can write your name there,
and rewrite the reason for us.

14:35.165 --> 14:36.292
SETTLEMENT LETTER

14:37.501 --> 14:38.335
Wait, are you…

14:39.295 --> 14:40.129
Yeah.

14:40.796 --> 14:43.674
You seem to have remembered me,
so I'll get to the point.

14:44.258 --> 14:47.595
I don't care
whether or not you killed Lee Seok-jae.

14:48.220 --> 14:49.305
What I care about

14:49.972 --> 14:52.141
is how Park Yeon-jin killed Yoon So-hee,

14:52.725 --> 14:55.144
and how Shin Yeong-jun cleaned it up.

14:56.228 --> 14:58.939
-What?
-You have Yeon-jin's name tag, don't you?

14:59.857 --> 15:01.775
I know you're keeping it
at the shaman's shrine.

15:02.359 --> 15:05.362
All you need to do is
submit that as evidence.

15:09.074 --> 15:10.409
So, what will it be?

15:11.285 --> 15:14.121
Will you give up Yeon-jin
and save yourself?

15:18.751 --> 15:19.960
That's my phone number.

15:21.921 --> 15:24.340
Will you become a murderer,

15:24.882 --> 15:28.886
or give me the name tag
and get charged with manslaughter?

15:30.346 --> 15:32.514
I bet it's an incredibly easy decision,

15:33.015 --> 15:35.517
but pretend that it's difficult
and think it over.

15:36.894 --> 15:39.772
As if you actually love your daughter.

15:42.608 --> 15:44.526
Call me when you've made up your mind.

15:57.373 --> 15:58.457
"Following last week,

15:58.540 --> 16:02.461
another cold wave warning has been issued
across the country this week…"

16:08.759 --> 16:10.219
"This morning will be cold,

16:10.302 --> 16:12.721
with the temperature
around minus ten degrees."

16:14.056 --> 16:17.559
It may be minus ten outside,
but you're on fire, Yeon-jin.

16:19.103 --> 16:21.522
What, the divorce?

16:21.605 --> 16:23.607
Don't you have internet at home?

16:24.858 --> 16:26.986
Did you just read
the article from yesterday?

16:28.404 --> 16:30.489
It's not an article. It's a video.

16:30.572 --> 16:32.908
You know, the bullying video
that was just posted.

16:41.792 --> 16:43.419
Are you deaf like your mom?

16:44.461 --> 16:47.047
Strip and stop freaking
talking back to me!

16:47.548 --> 16:49.133
I'm going to kill that bitch.

16:49.216 --> 16:50.801
Look at how pissed she is!

16:51.343 --> 16:52.761
Fuck, put that away!

16:52.845 --> 16:53.929
But why?

16:54.471 --> 16:55.597
Hey, she bolted!

17:02.187 --> 17:05.524
I told you. I'm not going down by myself.

17:06.525 --> 17:08.360
Have a nice day,

17:08.444 --> 17:09.945
you fucking bitch.

17:10.904 --> 17:13.282
UPLOADING VIDEO

17:13.365 --> 17:14.992
That post exposing Yeon-jin,

17:15.075 --> 17:17.745
didn't it say
that she killed somebody at school?

17:17.828 --> 17:19.496
Maybe it's all true.

17:19.580 --> 17:20.456
Park Yeon-jin!

17:21.665 --> 17:23.083
What is wrong with you?

17:23.167 --> 17:24.918
Why do you keep getting mentioned?

17:25.002 --> 17:28.505
School violence and murder,
what is all this about? Is it all true?

17:32.051 --> 17:33.469
Why is my life

17:34.720 --> 17:36.346
so damn hard?

17:50.235 --> 17:51.487
Sir!

17:52.529 --> 17:53.697
LETTER OF RESIGNATION

17:53.781 --> 17:55.866
It's true that I used to be a bully,

17:57.326 --> 17:58.911
but I didn't kill anybody.

18:10.422 --> 18:12.758
You're standing on ruins now

18:13.884 --> 18:16.553
without your beautiful walls, Yeon-jin.

18:18.263 --> 18:21.433
It'll be desolate. It'll be dark.

18:23.185 --> 18:25.354
Welcome, Yeon-jin.

18:29.608 --> 18:32.361
Take these away,
and don't let her get on the internet.

18:32.444 --> 18:33.320
Yes, ma'am.

18:35.364 --> 18:36.448
Puppy!

18:37.699 --> 18:41.870
You see, Mommy and Daddy
got into a tiny little fight.

18:44.039 --> 18:46.375
I have other things to take care of too--

18:46.458 --> 18:47.543
I saw everything.

18:48.877 --> 18:50.712
Did you bully your friend?

18:50.796 --> 18:52.506
Did you put something hot on her body?

18:54.424 --> 18:56.009
Seung-a says she's scared of me.

18:56.093 --> 18:58.762
She asked if I'm gonna bully her,
just like you.

19:00.973 --> 19:03.308
No, Ye-sol.

19:03.392 --> 19:05.644
I can meet with Seung-a's mother, and…

19:07.229 --> 19:08.313
Mom, get out.

19:08.397 --> 19:10.941
I don't want to be a weathercaster
when I grow up.

19:11.441 --> 19:13.527
I'm not proud of you anymore.

19:18.824 --> 19:22.828
I admit that I bullied a peer
back when I was still immature.

19:23.912 --> 19:24.913
But

19:25.998 --> 19:28.417
I never murdered anybody.

19:29.168 --> 19:30.669
In fact, I'm the victim.

19:32.045 --> 19:36.341
Her family has been making me suffer
for almost two decades.

19:37.176 --> 19:39.094
I have had to endure it all

19:39.595 --> 19:41.680
just because their child had died.

19:42.264 --> 19:44.016
But I have just filed a lawsuit

19:44.099 --> 19:46.101
regarding the one-sided claims

19:46.685 --> 19:48.353
made by her family members

19:49.271 --> 19:50.939
and the malicious comments.

19:53.650 --> 19:54.651
At one point,

19:56.278 --> 19:58.030
we were friends…

20:01.033 --> 20:03.535
so I didn't want to reveal this,

20:05.204 --> 20:06.205
but my classmate

20:07.831 --> 20:09.666
was pregnant at the time.

20:09.750 --> 20:10.709
Pregnant?

20:11.960 --> 20:13.253
Is that true?

20:13.337 --> 20:14.588
Can you prove that?

20:15.380 --> 20:19.051
It's in the case report,
so you can check for yourself.

20:19.134 --> 20:21.136
My pregnant classmate

20:21.970 --> 20:23.639
chose to kill herself.

20:25.891 --> 20:29.311
But I didn't say anything
because I wanted

20:30.229 --> 20:31.230
to keep her honor.

20:36.235 --> 20:38.695
I'm sorry to have to reveal
the truth like this.

20:41.240 --> 20:42.324
That's all.

20:42.991 --> 20:45.744
I have to attend
another friend's funeral today.

20:51.166 --> 20:53.252
Follow her.
I'll look into the case report.

20:53.335 --> 20:55.170
If it's true, I'll feel bad for her.

20:56.964 --> 20:58.715
Are you sure? Okay, bye.

21:01.176 --> 21:04.596
Park just held a press conference.
She's going to Son Myeong-o's funeral.

21:04.680 --> 21:06.098
Find out where that is.

21:07.015 --> 21:10.477
-Still not heard from the NFS?
-They need two more days. I'll rush them.

21:17.359 --> 21:20.028
What's up with you two? Been fighting?

21:20.112 --> 21:22.447
How could somebody like me fight her?

21:23.073 --> 21:24.741
I'm just a cheap plaything.

21:25.242 --> 21:26.410
You and your lisp.

21:26.493 --> 21:29.162
I can't understand half the shit you say.

21:29.246 --> 21:31.707
Say "penguin."

21:38.588 --> 21:41.008
You posted the video
of Yeon-jin bullying So-hee,

21:41.091 --> 21:43.593
but she refuted it right away
in a press conference.

21:43.677 --> 21:45.095
You must feel like shit now.

21:45.178 --> 21:46.263
But

21:47.556 --> 21:49.558
you'll miss this feeling, Sa-ra.

21:49.641 --> 21:51.727
What the hell are you talking about?

21:55.731 --> 21:57.858
SON OF A BITCH
YOU HAVE A NEW VIDEO

21:57.941 --> 22:00.068
I just got a text from a ghost.

22:00.152 --> 22:01.236
It's Myeong-o.

22:03.071 --> 22:04.573
What the hell are you on about?

22:23.175 --> 22:24.092
What's this?

22:24.968 --> 22:26.261
Season two of your shitshow?

22:27.346 --> 22:28.430
Holy!

22:29.348 --> 22:30.849
Sa-ra, isn't that you?

22:37.522 --> 22:38.523
That's not me.

22:39.232 --> 22:41.401
What is this? Who sent it?

22:41.485 --> 22:44.279
There's no way a dead guy sent it,
so who did this?

22:45.113 --> 22:46.698
That is you!

22:47.282 --> 22:49.368
Those eyeballs are definitely yours.

22:49.451 --> 22:50.744
The inebriated eyeballs.

22:50.827 --> 22:52.704
Another word that's hard to pronounce.

22:52.788 --> 22:55.374
I said it's not me.
Why the hell are you so excited?

22:55.457 --> 22:57.042
Turn it off, you fucking bitch!

22:57.125 --> 22:58.377
Freaking hilarious!

22:59.461 --> 23:01.213
You laughed as others got screwed over.

23:01.296 --> 23:03.965
Now it's about you,
you're suddenly deadly serious?

23:04.049 --> 23:04.883
Hey.

23:05.592 --> 23:06.760
It is you.

23:07.427 --> 23:08.428
Who's the guy?

23:08.929 --> 23:09.763
Hey.

23:10.972 --> 23:12.057
Hey, Sa-ra.

23:15.060 --> 23:16.561
What the fuck did you say?

23:16.645 --> 23:17.646
Ah, that's right.

23:18.605 --> 23:20.732
You probably wouldn't remember, would you?

23:21.233 --> 23:23.151
You were crawling on all fours
like a bitch.

23:23.652 --> 23:25.654
-I said, look this way.
-It's Myeong-o!

23:25.737 --> 23:27.656
You slept with him?

23:27.739 --> 23:29.491
-Wow, that prick.
-Stop filming!

23:29.991 --> 23:32.285
So he took more than just drugs from you.

23:32.369 --> 23:34.287
-That's not me!
-Look here, damn it.

23:34.371 --> 23:35.789
Who was it?

23:35.872 --> 23:37.707
Who sent it?

23:38.667 --> 23:41.420
What the hell was that for?
You're the one who fucked him!

23:41.503 --> 23:42.504
Fuck!

23:43.380 --> 23:44.297
Sa-ra.

23:46.216 --> 23:47.551
We need to talk.

23:48.635 --> 23:50.554
Was it you?

23:50.637 --> 23:52.139
What are you talking about?

23:52.848 --> 23:54.266
Step outside for a bit.

23:55.183 --> 23:58.645
We need to talk about
the video you posted, don't we?

24:00.063 --> 24:00.897
It was you.

24:01.815 --> 24:03.066
You were the bitch.

24:03.733 --> 24:06.653
Why? You want to bury your video
with one of mine again?

24:08.780 --> 24:10.282
Hey! Are you out of your mind?

24:10.365 --> 24:11.741
Are you on drugs?

24:12.284 --> 24:14.202
Let go! Let go of me!

24:16.288 --> 24:18.248
So much for acting all high and mighty.

24:18.331 --> 24:20.876
One of you posts a friend's video,

24:20.959 --> 24:23.712
and another one tells people
that the dead girl was pregnant.

24:23.795 --> 24:26.548
You guys are so freaking classy.

24:26.631 --> 24:27.716
She told people what?

24:29.217 --> 24:30.051
So it was you.

24:31.178 --> 24:33.680
Where do you think you're going,
you fucking bitch?

24:35.432 --> 24:37.058
To your church, you crazy bitch.

24:37.934 --> 24:41.021
I'm gonna play that video
in your church lobby, so get ready.

24:41.104 --> 24:42.939
Looks like videos are the death of you.

24:44.024 --> 24:46.776
You should've accepted my offer
to pay for the dress.

24:47.694 --> 24:49.362
You're unbelievable…

24:54.910 --> 24:58.205
Only Satan shall rejoice
in the pain of others!

24:59.498 --> 25:02.083
A bitch like you
who enjoys the pain of others

25:02.167 --> 25:03.752
should face judgment.

25:19.059 --> 25:20.560
Police! Get out of the way!

25:20.644 --> 25:22.020
Don't take that out!

25:22.604 --> 25:24.356
Let go of me! Fuck!

25:25.190 --> 25:26.274
You love my clothes.

25:26.983 --> 25:28.527
You can wear that to your funeral!

25:29.027 --> 25:30.237
Fuck!

25:32.280 --> 25:34.366
DECEASED: SON MYEONG-O (MALE/37)

25:50.465 --> 25:52.759
JOO YEO-JEONG PLASTIC SURGERY
DIRECTOR JOO YEO-JEONG

25:58.598 --> 26:01.309
You're a bit late.
I gave you that a while ago.

26:02.352 --> 26:04.437
You're not here for a diagnosis, are you?

26:04.521 --> 26:06.523
You weren't hurt that badly.

26:07.274 --> 26:08.525
Oh, right.

26:08.608 --> 26:11.027
Is your friend doing okay?
Ms. Choi Hye-jeong?

26:11.111 --> 26:12.696
I knew it. You know everything.

26:13.196 --> 26:14.739
You are working with Dong-eun.

26:17.659 --> 26:20.620
Hye-jeong went to a big hospital in Seoul,
so don't worry.

26:22.414 --> 26:24.749
What exactly is going on
between you and Dong-eun?

26:25.792 --> 26:26.876
Have you slept with her?

26:28.295 --> 26:29.796
You should be careful.

26:30.880 --> 26:34.634
I've gotten used to driving my new car,
so I might actually kill you today.

26:34.718 --> 26:38.346
You have shitty manners. I guess
that comes with being from a rich family.

26:39.306 --> 26:40.307
Anyway,

26:41.141 --> 26:42.809
so your mom owns Joo Hospital.

26:43.685 --> 26:45.103
I heard that's where So-hee is.

26:46.855 --> 26:48.356
She's been there for a while.

26:49.733 --> 26:50.567
And?

26:50.650 --> 26:52.736
I was wondering if I can see her.

26:53.945 --> 26:54.946
She's frozen, right?

26:55.739 --> 26:58.742
Are you going to do an autopsy
on her or something?

27:00.118 --> 27:03.121
What's your opinion as a doctor?
If you perform an autopsy,

27:05.040 --> 27:07.709
will the thing in her belly come out too?

27:11.921 --> 27:14.507
So Yoon So-hee was pregnant.

27:15.925 --> 27:17.844
I know nothing about forensics.

27:17.927 --> 27:21.097
And you need to be accompanied
by Ms. Yoon's family member, not me.

27:21.181 --> 27:25.310
If you want a procedure or treatment,
make a booking on your way out.

27:26.519 --> 27:30.106
I have a lot of patients to see today.
I'm going out of town tomorrow.

27:30.190 --> 27:32.567
Wow, you almost convinced me
to make a booking.

27:34.027 --> 27:34.944
No, thanks.

27:46.414 --> 27:47.332
Dr. Joo?

27:47.832 --> 27:51.419
Mr. Jeon didn't pay his bill
before he left.

27:52.003 --> 27:55.173
It's fine. He gave me something
that I really needed.

27:55.256 --> 27:56.091
You can go.

28:03.890 --> 28:06.393
INCREASE IN INTRAOCULAR PRESSURE
WHEN TAKING STEROID EYE DROPS

28:06.476 --> 28:07.560
GLAUCOMA MONITORING REQUIRED

28:18.780 --> 28:20.198
It wasn't Son Myeong-o.

28:21.991 --> 28:22.992
It was Jeon Jae-jun.

28:23.910 --> 28:25.578
The asshole that deserves to die.

28:30.291 --> 28:31.334
I didn't know.

28:31.960 --> 28:34.963
I can't believe I missed that.

28:37.090 --> 28:39.509
I guess
he wasn't just playing basketball, then.

28:49.811 --> 28:51.479
Do you know what time it is?

28:51.563 --> 28:53.815
You told me to hurry.
You said it was urgent--

28:58.611 --> 28:59.696
Mother.

28:59.779 --> 29:01.448
She's a member of my golf course.

29:02.490 --> 29:04.909
She loves the dumplings
they sell at our cafe.

29:08.955 --> 29:11.541
I was planning to give you a call.

29:12.208 --> 29:13.918
You saw the article, didn't you?

29:14.002 --> 29:16.087
I got into a small argument
with Ye-sol's dad.

29:16.171 --> 29:20.341
Still, getting a divorce seems
like a hasty decision, doesn't it?

29:20.425 --> 29:21.593
"Ye-sol's dad"?

29:22.761 --> 29:23.928
"Ye-sol's dad"?

29:31.019 --> 29:33.396
Why did you have to pick up the putter?

29:34.272 --> 29:36.024
This one hurts the most, you know.

29:36.107 --> 29:37.525
Stay out of this, Mr. Jeon.

29:38.109 --> 29:41.112
Whose child is she? Who is the bastard?

29:41.863 --> 29:45.033
Mr. Jeon said that Ye-sol

29:45.825 --> 29:47.118
isn't Do-yeong's kid.

29:50.497 --> 29:51.748
Have you lost your mind?

29:53.208 --> 29:55.794
Jeez, I forgot to tell you about that.

30:00.632 --> 30:01.883
I'm that bastard.

30:02.634 --> 30:03.635
Ye-sol is my kid.

30:07.889 --> 30:08.723
What?

30:08.807 --> 30:09.641
But

30:10.642 --> 30:14.813
it makes no sense for your son
to raise my daughter, does it?

30:15.313 --> 30:16.481
So I'd like to ask.

30:18.191 --> 30:21.444
Could you please disown my daughter?

30:21.945 --> 30:25.031
You crazy asshole!

30:29.744 --> 30:30.912
You pieces of shit.

30:31.788 --> 30:33.957
You two have made a terrible mistake.

30:34.916 --> 30:37.168
How dare you deceive my son?

30:51.224 --> 30:52.475
Yoon So-hee, you said?

30:52.559 --> 30:56.563
Yes, I want to pay the overdue storage fee
for a body that was admitted in 2004.

30:56.646 --> 30:58.147
Oh, right.

30:59.357 --> 31:01.693
I guess you can say
you're a second too late.

31:01.776 --> 31:03.444
That was paid off a while ago.

31:05.864 --> 31:06.698
By who?

31:07.782 --> 31:10.118
Jaepyeong Construction's CEO, Ha Do-yeong.

31:14.539 --> 31:15.623
Thank you.

31:24.048 --> 31:25.466
Is this the kind of moment

31:26.050 --> 31:28.136
that Director Joo was waiting for?

31:48.948 --> 31:51.242
Are you going on a business trip?

31:53.828 --> 31:54.829
One moment.

31:55.455 --> 31:56.372
MOTHER

32:02.837 --> 32:05.173
Your wage and severance pay
will be deposited.

32:06.257 --> 32:07.675
Thank you for everything.

32:11.471 --> 32:13.890
Three, four, five…

32:15.058 --> 32:15.934
One…

32:18.102 --> 32:18.937
Ye-sol.

32:19.979 --> 32:20.813
Ye-sol!

32:22.815 --> 32:23.733
Oh, my.

32:24.359 --> 32:25.276
Ye-sol!

32:33.826 --> 32:34.827
Hey, princess!

32:38.414 --> 32:39.999
Dad!

32:46.631 --> 32:48.675
Dad, I'm sorry.

32:53.888 --> 32:56.224
No, princess.
You have nothing to be sorry about.

32:59.143 --> 33:01.896
Nothing that's happening right now

33:03.272 --> 33:04.524
is your fault.

33:05.400 --> 33:06.651
Do you understand?

33:06.734 --> 33:08.820
Daddy!

33:25.753 --> 33:27.005
I have a favor to ask.

33:28.006 --> 33:29.507
Please give this to Seong-hee,

33:30.008 --> 33:33.302
and give this to the school nurse.

33:33.803 --> 33:35.888
I've put a note for them inside the bag.

33:38.182 --> 33:39.183
So this is

33:40.601 --> 33:42.937
my last mission.

33:45.356 --> 33:46.190
Yes.

33:47.608 --> 33:49.444
Thank you for everything.

33:51.904 --> 33:56.159
Go to the world you wanted to be part of.

33:57.285 --> 34:00.705
There, you don't have to be my helper.

34:01.497 --> 34:04.500
You can be who you are. A cheerful person.

34:21.559 --> 34:22.727
Did you bring eggs again?

34:31.736 --> 34:32.904
Don't cry.

34:33.988 --> 34:36.157
I want to leave with a smile.

34:44.499 --> 34:45.583
Sometimes I wondered

34:47.168 --> 34:48.711
what you were like

34:50.004 --> 34:51.672
when you were a kid.

34:55.593 --> 34:57.845
You're so pretty when you smile.

35:02.183 --> 35:03.101
Really?

35:06.646 --> 35:08.356
What was I like when I was a kid?

35:11.359 --> 35:12.527
I can't remember.

35:25.957 --> 35:26.958
Good…

35:28.126 --> 35:30.128
Good luck, Ms. Moon.

35:32.088 --> 35:33.131
Thank you.

35:36.050 --> 35:38.386
Let's not see each other again.

36:24.432 --> 36:25.266
Gyeong-ran!

36:25.349 --> 36:26.559
Hey.

36:26.642 --> 36:28.186
-Did you drink water?
-Yeah.

36:28.269 --> 36:29.604
It's so hot.

36:29.687 --> 36:31.189
Let's go there after school.

36:31.272 --> 36:33.232
-Let's order fries too.
-Sure.

36:33.316 --> 36:34.859
That karaoke booth rocks!

38:17.295 --> 38:18.129
NO LAUNDRY

38:28.723 --> 38:31.475
You aren't supposed to do laundry here.

38:34.478 --> 38:35.313
A part-timer?

38:37.023 --> 38:38.441
You're good at your job.

38:48.743 --> 38:50.453
She owns the real estate office.

38:51.245 --> 38:53.748
Her son died recently,
so she's gone a bit nuts.

38:54.832 --> 38:56.083
In a drunk driving accident.

38:57.585 --> 38:58.586
Leave her be.

39:08.054 --> 39:08.971
Welcome.

39:09.055 --> 39:11.474
She said you saved her life.

39:35.956 --> 39:38.167
Let's keep an eye on the scar on her neck.

39:38.250 --> 39:41.712
As for her voice,
we'll keep an eye on that too.

39:42.380 --> 39:44.298
Is "keeping an eye" all your job entails?

39:44.799 --> 39:47.510
So, will she be able to speak or not?

39:47.593 --> 39:49.303
Her vocal cords are badly damaged,

39:49.387 --> 39:52.390
so it's impossible for her
to contract and relax them.

39:52.473 --> 39:54.225
Right now, it seems unlikely.

39:54.308 --> 39:56.477
But sometimes, voices do come back.

39:56.560 --> 39:57.812
HOW OFTEN IS "SOMETIMES"?

39:58.396 --> 39:59.980
How often is "sometimes"?

40:00.064 --> 40:01.857
Well, miracles do happen.

40:02.691 --> 40:04.860
Ms. Choi, please don't try to talk.

40:10.658 --> 40:11.492
Wow.

40:12.159 --> 40:13.994
Well, he said it would be a miracle.

40:14.912 --> 40:17.581
Anyway, I'll pack and send your stuff.

40:19.083 --> 40:21.836
I never have to worry about you
because you're so brave.

40:21.919 --> 40:23.879
Let me know if you need anything.

40:24.380 --> 40:26.966
Oh, sorry. I forgot that you can't talk.

40:28.801 --> 40:30.886
YOU CAN'T DO THIS TO ME!

40:30.970 --> 40:33.722
Hey, the doctor said you shouldn't talk.

40:34.890 --> 40:36.809
Are you saying
that I can't do this to you?

40:37.935 --> 40:39.019
Why?

40:39.103 --> 40:39.937
Oh.

40:40.813 --> 40:41.981
The recording?

40:44.692 --> 40:46.026
I erased everything.

40:46.986 --> 40:49.196
You told me that the password is "696969."

40:50.656 --> 40:52.908
YOU SON OF A BITCH!

40:52.992 --> 40:55.327
I know, I'm a son of a bitch.

40:56.662 --> 40:58.664
Come on now. You really shouldn't talk.

40:59.290 --> 41:01.625
Hey, you should smoke menthols.

41:02.376 --> 41:03.752
That clears your throat up.

41:06.755 --> 41:10.009
I'M GOING TO KILL YOU! I'LL KILL YOU!

41:17.641 --> 41:20.895
Lee will be put on trial for
aggravated assault and attempted murder.

41:20.978 --> 41:25.733
Pastor Lee Gil-seong, her father,
has also been arrested for tax evasion.

41:26.275 --> 41:29.361
The offerings and slush funds
he embezzled for almost 20 years

41:29.445 --> 41:31.989
are estimated to be worth
tens of billions of won.

41:32.573 --> 41:34.074
I saw the news.

41:34.909 --> 41:36.494
It looks like we're almost there.

41:37.077 --> 41:39.330
Congratulations on causing the ruin.

41:39.413 --> 41:43.000
I may have set the plan in motion,
but they caused the ruin themselves.

41:43.501 --> 41:45.002
And you made it reach 100%.

41:46.670 --> 41:49.006
You're the one who perfected it.

41:57.306 --> 41:59.141
Turn around. Don't look.

41:59.892 --> 42:02.311
You must only look at pretty things.
This isn't.

42:05.523 --> 42:07.107
No, I have to look.

42:08.150 --> 42:10.402
My headsman is performing
a sword dance for me.

42:13.030 --> 42:13.948
Here we go!

42:50.818 --> 42:51.735
Detective.

42:52.236 --> 42:54.572
The DNA results
for Son's fingernails are in.

42:55.155 --> 42:56.323
It's weird though.

42:58.033 --> 42:59.201
What's weird?

42:59.285 --> 43:02.746
You know the lighter from the Yoon So-hee
crime scene 18 years ago?

43:02.830 --> 43:06.917
The DNA from the lighter matches
the DNA from under Son's fingernails.

43:07.835 --> 43:08.794
What's going on here?

43:09.503 --> 43:12.923
Get DNA samples of everyone involved
in the Yoon So-hee incident.

43:13.007 --> 43:14.091
All right.

43:14.967 --> 43:17.219
I'd like to give my special thanks to you.

43:21.724 --> 43:24.143
I'll be a bit late today.
I'm going out of town.

43:25.394 --> 43:26.478
To where?

43:26.562 --> 43:28.647
CHOI HYE-JEONG

43:28.731 --> 43:30.024
To Doctor Joo Yeo-jeong.

43:31.191 --> 43:32.526
It's quite far away.

43:33.235 --> 43:34.403
I'll see you tonight.

43:37.948 --> 43:40.451
Hello, Dr. Joo. This is Kang Yeong-cheon.

43:43.162 --> 43:46.165
I can't even imagine the grief
of losing a family member,

43:47.541 --> 43:50.169
but allow me to write
a few words of apology.

43:51.086 --> 43:53.005
Our meeting was short-lived,

43:54.131 --> 43:57.259
but I remember your father
as a very good man.

43:59.386 --> 44:03.641
He did his best to treat me,
even though I'm a murderer.

44:04.266 --> 44:05.684
You have a visitor, 3724.

44:13.942 --> 44:14.860
We meet again.

44:17.655 --> 44:20.240
I'm here for the answer
I didn't get to hear last time.

44:21.075 --> 44:25.579
You said you'd show me the hell
you're living in if we met again.

44:28.040 --> 44:29.333
You didn't give a reason.

44:31.001 --> 44:32.670
Not even at the trial.

44:35.005 --> 44:36.006
Answer me.

44:44.848 --> 44:46.934
Is this the hell you're living in?

44:51.105 --> 44:52.439
But things are far from over.

44:58.278 --> 44:59.613
Why did you…

45:02.032 --> 45:03.534
kill my father?

45:11.291 --> 45:13.293
Everyone refused to operate on me.

45:14.712 --> 45:17.548
My broken arm was hurting so much,
I thought I might die.

45:18.048 --> 45:20.217
Blood was gushing out of me,

45:20.300 --> 45:23.345
but they wouldn't even touch me
because I was a murderer.

45:24.263 --> 45:25.931
That's when your father walked in.

45:33.564 --> 45:35.566
Move aside, please. Everybody, move.

45:40.904 --> 45:43.991
I'll do it. Get an IV on him.
Let's do a CT scan.

45:44.074 --> 45:46.577
Please uncuff him.
I can't treat him like this.

45:46.660 --> 45:47.494
Sir.

45:47.995 --> 45:49.913
Please don't.
Send him to another hospital.

45:49.997 --> 45:51.915
What happens there? And their doctors?

45:53.000 --> 45:56.503
It's the court's job to punish him.
It's ours to save him and send him there.

45:58.797 --> 46:00.632
Can somebody call Yeo-jeong?

46:01.425 --> 46:03.761
We have dinner plans,
so he should be on his way.

46:03.844 --> 46:06.680
Tell him to go home
and to not eat instant noodles.

46:07.431 --> 46:09.224
He really likes to eat them.

46:17.524 --> 46:20.277
I mean, I was dying,
and he talks about instant noodles?

46:20.360 --> 46:24.031
From my point of view,
isn't that super insulting?

46:25.741 --> 46:29.912
Anyway, the operation began
and I woke up in the middle of it.

46:30.496 --> 46:33.916
One of my arms was free,
and the scalpel was near me.

46:40.964 --> 46:43.300
Do you know who I wanted to see
at that moment?

46:46.720 --> 46:47.638
Yes.

46:48.263 --> 46:50.766
The director's son
who loves instant noodles!

46:50.849 --> 46:52.351
That's why I did it.

46:53.811 --> 46:56.396
You'd show up if your father died,
so I went "slit."

46:56.980 --> 47:00.692
I used the scalpel
to make you come running to me.

47:05.656 --> 47:07.825
I want to honor
the wishes of my late father

47:07.908 --> 47:09.827
and provide my services.

47:11.119 --> 47:14.957
He always said that if I chose
the medical profession as my mission,

47:15.040 --> 47:18.585
I should think of providing my service
as my calling.

47:19.753 --> 47:22.840
Cultivating law and order,
and rehabilitating for hope and tomorrow.

47:22.923 --> 47:25.467
I think a sound body makes them possible.

47:29.680 --> 47:31.932
I admire your wishes, Dr. Joo.

47:32.015 --> 47:34.518
But I can't hire
the family member of a victim.

47:37.312 --> 47:41.233
So in the end, you're the one
who killed your father, not me.

48:35.621 --> 48:36.705
Come in.

48:36.788 --> 48:37.706
Mom.

48:38.749 --> 48:39.791
Huh?

48:39.875 --> 48:42.920
Hello, stranger.
You've lost a lot of weight, Mom.

48:43.003 --> 48:46.048
I've only been eating greens
so I can wear a bikini, but I'm screwed.

48:46.548 --> 48:48.425
Rash vests are trendy nowadays.

48:49.885 --> 48:52.220
You lost your chance
of getting a European stepdad.

48:52.888 --> 48:54.890
Where from? An Italian stepdad?

48:57.351 --> 48:58.185
Have you been crying?

48:59.144 --> 49:01.146
Why would I cry?
I have nothing to cry about.

49:01.772 --> 49:03.607
I'm hungry. Buy me a meal.

49:03.690 --> 49:06.777
I'll get a list of the best places
from Jong-heon, so wait here.

49:07.778 --> 49:09.196
Get a haircut!

49:10.030 --> 49:13.367
Come on, you need to make use
of that handsome face I gave you.

49:13.450 --> 49:15.160
I plan to grow my hair and braid it.

49:33.261 --> 49:36.056
-Mr. Ha is on annual leave right now.
-I know.

49:36.807 --> 49:38.308
You and I talked on the phone.

49:39.393 --> 49:40.644
So I know.

49:41.937 --> 49:43.605
I know that, but…

49:47.025 --> 49:49.027
this was the only place I had to go.

50:04.167 --> 50:07.421
You don't know, do you?
The name tag that you lost.

50:08.005 --> 50:10.465
I'm the one who sent it to the police.

50:13.427 --> 50:16.513
Back then, I didn't get to make
good use of that name tag.

50:17.014 --> 50:18.682
So I'll do that today.

50:21.977 --> 50:22.978
PARK YEON-JIN

50:25.230 --> 50:27.733
Chief Shin swiped it
from the police station,

50:28.567 --> 50:31.319
and I've been holding onto it.
Are we done now?

50:32.029 --> 50:34.781
No, this is only the beginning.

50:43.623 --> 50:45.625
-Mom.
-You…

50:46.877 --> 50:47.878
Why are you…

50:49.838 --> 50:50.672
You called her?

50:50.756 --> 50:52.466
Yeon-jin deserves to know too.

50:55.802 --> 50:58.638
Your mother chose to give you up
and save herself.

50:59.181 --> 51:00.515
You said so yourself,

51:01.308 --> 51:03.643
your parents are the ones
that do you the most harm.

51:04.227 --> 51:05.228
You fucking bitch!

51:05.979 --> 51:07.314
I'll give it to you.

51:08.732 --> 51:10.150
That's where it belongs.

51:13.862 --> 51:15.113
But you know what?

51:16.114 --> 51:18.575
This name tag can't be used
as evidence anyway.

51:19.076 --> 51:22.079
It wasn't found at the crime scene.

51:22.162 --> 51:23.580
It was found much later.

51:26.750 --> 51:30.087
I never needed your mother's testimony.

51:31.338 --> 51:32.589
I just wanted to know

51:33.799 --> 51:36.384
to what extent you'd be abandoned.

51:38.762 --> 51:40.013
Now we know.

51:41.348 --> 51:43.266
We both do.

51:58.323 --> 51:59.157
Mom.

52:03.245 --> 52:04.663
What have you done?

52:12.712 --> 52:13.880
How could you?

52:17.717 --> 52:20.303
How can you do this to your own daughter?

52:20.387 --> 52:22.639
Did you expect me to go down with you?

52:23.473 --> 52:25.976
After you let that bitch
cause this whole mess?

52:26.977 --> 52:27.894
Go on.

52:28.687 --> 52:30.897
You try having a good relationship
with your kid.

52:31.648 --> 52:33.066
Because I couldn't.

52:36.403 --> 52:37.237
Mom.

52:39.906 --> 52:42.659
Mom!

52:46.079 --> 52:49.082
Mom!

52:51.668 --> 52:54.588
I know mothers
who willingly chose to live in hell

52:55.130 --> 52:58.383
in order to save their children, Yeon-jin.

52:58.466 --> 52:59.801
Those crazy bitches.

52:59.885 --> 53:02.554
How dare they make such a scene
at a funeral?

53:03.471 --> 53:04.389
Damn it!

54:03.240 --> 54:04.157
So,

54:05.492 --> 54:07.744
don't think that this is all over.

54:08.828 --> 54:11.331
And don't assume
that you've been punished enough.

54:14.084 --> 54:18.004
After all, Myeong-o's the only one
who got a funeral.

54:21.049 --> 54:23.677
INCOMING CALL
SEONG-HEE

54:24.261 --> 54:25.262
Hey, Seong-hee.

54:26.471 --> 54:29.808
Dong-eun, I'm at Sunghan-dong.
Ms. Kim just collapsed!

54:35.063 --> 54:36.314
I think she collapsed.

54:37.899 --> 54:38.733
My goodness.

54:44.281 --> 54:45.949
Ms. Kim Gil-nyeo's guardian?

54:46.908 --> 54:47.742
Yes.

54:51.788 --> 54:53.290
How are you related?

54:53.873 --> 54:56.042
I'm an acquaintance. She has no family.

54:57.127 --> 54:58.461
One moment, please.

54:59.546 --> 55:00.380
Look at this.

55:00.880 --> 55:03.300
The note says
Dr. Joo Yeo-jeong is her guardian.

55:04.342 --> 55:06.261
He must be eating
with the director right now.

55:09.639 --> 55:12.392
Hey, it's me.
What's up with this note on the chart?

55:44.090 --> 55:45.216
When did you get here?

55:50.722 --> 55:52.557
So-hee's mother's guardian,

55:54.434 --> 55:55.685
is you.

55:58.271 --> 56:01.191
I asked about that note on the chart.

56:03.026 --> 56:05.236
It was made
before we met again on the train.

56:17.624 --> 56:19.209
Have you known all along…

56:21.294 --> 56:22.545
that I…

56:24.923 --> 56:26.424
approached you on purpose?

58:28.171 --> 58:33.176
Subtitle translation by: Daham Yoon
